  lines:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "(Ayame me est\xE1 hablando pero no escucho lo que dice.)"
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: (Lo unico que existe en mi mente es su trasero. Lo unico que huelo es su
      olor natural mezclado con el limpiasuelos.)
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "(Se me ha olvidado como andar, esta situaci\xF3n ocupa todos mis pensamientos.
      Si tropiezo ahora y me caigo har\xE9 el mayor ridiculo de mi vida.)"
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc228ba2da24648935c80e69a2da2ad, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "\xBFShouta? \xBFTe pasa algo?"
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "(Se gira hacia mi. Pierdo su trasero de vista. Pero ahora lo que veo es
      su cara pegada a la m\xEDa. \xBFSiempre ha tenido esos ojos azules tan profundos?)"
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc228ba2da24648935c80e69a2da2ad, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Est\xE1s colorado. \xBFNo tendr\xE1s fiebre?"
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: No. Es que hace mucho calor es solo eso. No estoy acostumbrado a este clima.
      No es como el de Tokio.
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc228ba2da24648935c80e69a2da2ad, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Que susto me has dado. Si, hoy hace bastante calor. Pero a partir de ma\xF1ana
      bajan un poco las temperaturas."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc228ba2da24648935c80e69a2da2ad, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Que susto me has dado. Si, hoy hace bastante calor. Pero a partir de ma\xF1ana
      bajan un poco las temperaturas."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc228ba2da24648935c80e69a2da2ad, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Ven, tu cuarto est\xE1 justo aqu\xED."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Si, perdona. No quer\xEDa asustarte, prima."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
